                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0a1714c0-6fa0-320f-ac9d-c3d35aee1881",
                        "entry_id": "2a69137d-b82d-3c8a-9e9f-a64226746848",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The process of annexing"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "45ff16f8-1cee-468a-bf35-603c1d6a940f",
                                "sense_id": "0a1714c0-6fa0-320f-ac9d-c3d35aee1881",
                                "text": "Avulsio is the increase in extent of land bounded by water, through the annexure of land disannexed elsewhere by violent natural causes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9c384921-ee36-44a5-9244-bd0fb80e2f28",
                                "sense_id": "0a1714c0-6fa0-320f-ac9d-c3d35aee1881",
                                "text": "Plundering, raiding and annexure of other weaker nations have become survival normality and we seem to accept these as part of life."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f796261d-db96-40c2-ab36-e01ab9d2eacb",
                                "sense_id": "0a1714c0-6fa0-320f-ac9d-c3d35aee1881",
                                "text": "I doubt if there'll be much opposition to my annexure of the throne!"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7fcf136-f809-4b0d-84ec-c3c80bbda6fe",
                                "sense_id": "0a1714c0-6fa0-320f-ac9d-c3d35aee1881",
                                "text": "C. Rajagopan's The Greater Bombay: A Study in Suburban Ecology (Bombay: Popular Book depot, 1962) is one study, especially interesting as it was undertaken in the immediate aftermath of the annexure of Salsette to Bombay and thus offers a contemporary perspective."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f638a7d2-406c-3c48-aad6-4d489558afc8",
                        "entry_id": "2a69137d-b82d-3c8a-9e9f-a64226746848",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Something annexed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "UK",
                            "countable",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ff7ed18-e9a0-4dec-8ca4-76a4f83bae38",
                                "sense_id": "f638a7d2-406c-3c48-aad6-4d489558afc8",
                                "text": "...other hand buildings without foundations,sheds, windmills, railway lines, and all fixtures or annexures to buildings, are movable unless their owner intended that they should be permanently annexed."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "2cb54d43-d770-4f57-aed3-2f92568a8828",
                                "sense_id": "f638a7d2-406c-3c48-aad6-4d489558afc8",
                                "text": "While determining the quantum of such return on the investments, the cost incurred for the building, as it is, with all the existing annexures intended for the better enjoyment of the premises themselves, shall have to be taken into account."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9061cc3-5850-4a13-ac61-a554c8189954",
                                "sense_id": "f638a7d2-406c-3c48-aad6-4d489558afc8",
                                "text": "This implication is supported by other provisions of the Mortgage Law, such as the provision that makes the mortgage effective against all annexures to the mortgaged property (such as buildings, plants, services, constructions, and modifications), expressly including those coming into being subsequent to the mortgage deed, unless the mortgagor or and the mortgagee otherwise agree."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "fa8264b8-bfc9-495d-9516-e54f096ed708",
                                "sense_id": "f638a7d2-406c-3c48-aad6-4d489558afc8",
                                "text": "The Saudi Arabian law regarding annexures is that a charge is effective against all annexures to the charged property (for example, buildings, plants, services, constructions and modifications), expressly including those that come into being subsequent to the rahn deed, unless the chargor and chargee otherwise agree."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "14b07fbc-3aff-3351-9fc6-e665ca707406",
                        "entry_id": "2a69137d-b82d-3c8a-9e9f-a64226746848",
                        "glosses": [
                            "An appendix or attachment to a document."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "India",
                            "UK",
                            "countable",
                            "especially",
                            "uncountable"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "66b77ed0-8395-40c0-a251-50b737f47f18",
                                "sense_id": "14b07fbc-3aff-3351-9fc6-e665ca707406",
                                "text": "This aspect of the publication appears in one of the annexures at the end of the lectures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "29cb834b-c9d1-468c-8e3e-b9dd9b4768c1",
                                "sense_id": "14b07fbc-3aff-3351-9fc6-e665ca707406",
                                "text": "In addition a comprehensive set of annexures had to be submitted with each application that included the following […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4befa487-c42f-4c9d-ab5f-1b53ed1ae514",
                                "sense_id": "14b07fbc-3aff-3351-9fc6-e665ca707406",
                                "text": "The reports of the seminars and their recommendations are included in the annexures of the book. The population data and other relevant information are also given in the annexures."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "beeb4bb6-be27-4183-8b8f-1f9ccfbfad6b",
                                "sense_id": "14b07fbc-3aff-3351-9fc6-e665ca707406",
                                "text": "An affidavit may refer to and identify documents and other things which are part of the evidence-in-chief of a witness. These are referred to variously as annexures or exhibits. A neutral term used here for annexures and exhibits is 'attachment'."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
